{"text":"That night you squeeze in between the roots of a giant tree. You're shaking. You don't want to sleep. In the dark, you open your backpack, looking for anything that makes sense. The library book. On the cover, a T. rex skeleton in a museum. You don't look closely. Inside, chapter seven. Who Survived. Animals that were small. Animals that hid underground. Animals that lived near fresh water. On the back page, with your school pen, you write a plan. Three things. Ten days. None of them done. You don't decide to fall asleep. Your body decides for you.","alignment":{"characters":["T","h","a","t"," ","n","i","g","h","t"," ","y","o","u"," ","s","q","u","e","e","z","e"," ","i","n"," ","b","e","t","w","e","e","n"," ","t","h","e"," ","r","o","o","t","s"," ","o","f"," ","a"," ","g","i","a","n","t"," ","t","r","e","e","."," ","Y","o","u","'","r","e"," ","s","h","a","k","i","n","g","."," ","Y","o","u"," ","d","o","n","'","t"," ","w","a","n","t"," ","t","o"," ","s","l","e","e","p","."," ","I","n"," ","t","h","e"," ","d","a","r","k",","," ","y","o","u"," ","o","p","e","n"," ","y","o","u","r"," ","b","a","c","k","p","a","c","k",","," ","l","o","o","k","i","n","g"," ","f","o","r"," ","a","n","y","t","h","i","n","g"," ","t","h","a","t"," ","m","a","k","e","s"," ","s","e","n","s","e","."," ","T","h","e"," ","l","i","b","r","a","r","y"," ","b","o","o","k","."," ","O","n"," ","t","h","e"," ","c","o","v","e","r",","," ","a"," ","T","."," ","r","e","x"," ","s","k","e","l","e","t","o","n"," ","i","n"," ","a"," ","m","u","s","e","u","m","."," ","Y","o","u"," ","d","o","n","'","t"," ","l","o","o","k"," ","c","l","o","s","e","l","y","."," ","I","n","s","i","d","e",","," ","c","h","a","p","t","e","r"," ","s","e","v","e","n","."," ","W","h","o"," ","S","u","r","v","i","v","e","d","."," ","A","n","i","m","a","l","s"," ","t","h","a","t"," ","w","e","r","e"," ","s","m","a","l","l","."," ","A","n","i","m","a","l","s"," ","t","h","a","t"," ","h","i","d"," ","u","n","d","e","r","g","r","o",